SUMMARY:Total solar eclipse
LOCATION:Sky event\; visibility region in description\, Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Totality crossed Greenland\, Iceland\, Spain\, Russia\, and a s
 mall part of Portugal\; Toronto experienced a partial eclipse. NASA gives 
 greatest eclipse at 17:47:06 TD (17:46 UT). Historical political\, ritual\
 , and mythic interpretations remain distinct from the physical eclipse and
  its visibility. The listed time is NASA’s global greatest-eclipse predi
 ction in UT\, rounded to the minute\; local visibility and observing times
  depend on location.
URL:https://seminarschools.com/polymythseminars/events/total-solar-eclipse-
 2026-08-12/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
